                                "sense_id": "e9ccab86-8c4f-35f5-8509-e1a94ad30344",
                                "text": "The concierge began talking on the phone in the local pidgin. “Eh, anikala Moki, diz Rodney at work, howzit? I get one winnah for you today. Diz guys like go Miloliʻi … no kidding uncle, four poʻe ipukea kane, come now. Shoots.”"
